{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026sUkPSBDow01793025955.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>Facebook母公司Meta計劃進行股本融資，籌集最多950億美元。</p><p></p><p>《彭博》報道，Meta計劃公開發行總值350億美元的普通股及優先股，並透過ATM增發機制，可按市場價格增發股票，集資600億美元，但有關股票沒有投票權。集資款項用於支持AI基礎設施，及個人超級智能領域。Meta早前承諾將投入約8,250億美元，發展AI和算力設施。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T16:01:08.336781+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":168,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T14:45:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T08:58:21.362735+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T15:58:13.867658+00:00","content_hash":"16fbc172c56316958ee55f4e9333e22f4adde3588c7a423a2d96683e9f450621","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-26T16:01:08.336781+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}